{"id":"n74396-1-8","stage":0,"title":"어머님 · 母亲","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74396-1-8-1","ko":"이 분이 제 어머님이세요.","zh":"这位就是我的母亲。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"指代“这个人”。","explanation":"이：指代“这个人”。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"3","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분이","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머님이세요.","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머님：母亲，妈妈；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어머님","audio":"/audio/82b7122898a050234986.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74396","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"指代“这个人”。","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代“这个人”。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"82b7122898a05023","term":"어머님","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/82b7122898a050234986.mp3","entryId":"74396","definition":"(尊称)用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머님"]}],"audio":"/audio/29095e8c7a98028da82c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74396-1-8-2","ko":"유민이 어머니이시군요. 만나서 반갑습니다.","zh":"原来您是裕敏的母亲啊，很高兴见到您。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이","audio":"/audio/b0f813b33e356d859fe9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"어머니이시군요.","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나서","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반갑습니다.","meaning":"高兴，开心，喜悦","explanation":"반갑다：高兴，开心，喜悦；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70861","senseId":"1","lemma":"반갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"d5cacddd111bc906","term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴，开心，喜悦","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3","entryId":"70861","definition":"因见到想见的人或实现了愿望而感到欢喜愉快。","pronunciation":["반갑따"]}],"audio":"/audio/03a652c5624d5a6b5c47.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74396","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":22,"sequenceScore":0.8521,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这位就是我的母亲。","原来您是裕敏的母亲啊，很高兴见到您。","这套书的第六卷你看了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这位就是我的母亲。","原来您是裕敏的母亲啊，很高兴见到您。","这套书的第六卷你看了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
